{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_25", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_26", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - CAPTURE AND ORGANIZE EVERY LEAD", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - CAPTURE AND ORGANIZE EVERY LEAD", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_27", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Lead capture and contact management share this section. Your forms feed GHL directly, and tags and custom fields sort each contact as it\narrives.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Lead capture and contact management share this section. Your forms feed GHL directly, and tags and custom fields sort each contact as it\narrives.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_28", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - KEEP THE PIPELINE UP TO DATE", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - KEEP THE PIPELINE UP TO DATE", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Each lead becomes an opportunity in your pipeline, and what the lead does moves it between\nstages. We map the stages from how your team sells today.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Each lead becomes an opportunity in your pipeline, and what the lead does moves it between\nstages. We map the stages from how your team sells today.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_31", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - FOLLOW UP AND NURTURE AUTOMATICALLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - FOLLOW UP AND NURTURE AUTOMATICALLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every message depends on what the lead has done, and a reply or a booking stops the\nautomated ones. Texts only deliver once your GHL number is registered for business texting.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every message depends on what the lead has done, and a reply or a booking stops the\nautomated ones. Texts only deliver once your GHL number is registered for business texting.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_34", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2942, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 2964, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - TASKS AND ALERTS FOR YOUR TEAM", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - TASKS AND ALERTS FOR YOUR TEAM", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 2964, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Task assignments and notifications share this section. Your team is told who to call and\nwhen, based on lead activity and pipeline stage.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Task assignments and notifications share this section. Your team is told who to call and\nwhen, based on lead activity and pipeline stage.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_37", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3840, "y": -90, "width": 1048, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 3862, "y": -74, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - TEST IT AND HAND IT TO YOUR TEAM", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - TEST IT AND HAND IT TO YOUR TEAM", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_39", "type": "text", "x": 3862, "y": -38, "width": 1004, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every workflow is tested with test leads before it touches a real one. Everything is named and organized so your team can manage it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every workflow is tested with test leads before it touches a real one. Everything is named and organized so your team can manage it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_40"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - A new lead fills in your\nGHL form and lands in the CRM\nwithout anyone typing it", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - A new lead fills in your\nGHL form and lands in the CRM\nwithout anyone typing it", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": fal